          "description": "Whenever this unit defeats a non-conjured enemy with an attack, an Imposter is added to the next in line of enemy reinforcements.\n\nIf this unit would be defeated by an enemy attack or a status effect while having more than 1 HP, it instead survives with 1 HP.\n\nIf this unit is burning, this unit:\n- Cannot be Stunned.\n- Has 50% damage reduction from attacks."
